---

# {{ name }}{% if deprecated %} <span class="deprecated-badge">Deprecated</span>{% endif %}

{% if infographic_path %}
![{{ name }} Infographic]({{ infographic_path }})
{: .component-hero }
{% endif %}

{% if deprecated %}
!!! warning "Deprecated Component"
    {{ deprecated_reason | default("This component is deprecated and may be removed in future versions.") }}
    {% if replacement %}**Replacement:** [{{ replacement }}]({{ replacement_link }}){% endif %}
{% endif %}

## Overview

<div class="component-meta" markdown>
| Attribute | Value |
|-----------|-------|
| **Type** | {{ type | title }} |
| **Purpose** | {{ purpose }} |
| **Complexity** | {{ complexity | default("Medium") }} |
| **Model** | {{ model | default("sonnet") }} |
{% if category %}| **Category** | {{ category }} |{% endif %}
{% if created %}| **Created** | {{ created }} |{% endif %}
{% if confidence < 80 %}| **Confidence** | <span class="confidence-badge confidence-{{ 'high' if confidence >= 80 else ('medium' if confidence >= 50 else 'low') }}">{{ confidence }}%</span> |{% endif %}
</div>

{% if tags %}
<div class="component-tags">
{% for tag in tags %}
<span class="tag tag-{{ tag | lower | replace(' ', '-') }}">{{ tag }}</span>
{% endfor %}
</div>
{% endif %}

